mount\":240000,\"withholding_rate\":0.1,\"tax_withheld\":24000,\"net_amount\":216000,\"basis\":\"W-8BEN-E, treaty claim to Luxembourg (F-006, valid to 2027-12-31); clearance CL-006 valid on payment date; R-02.2027.1 (10% treaty rate for US-source dividend paid to Luxembourg resident)\"},{\"recipient_no\":\"I-007\",\"component\":\"DIV\",\"outcome\":\"cleared\",\"gross_amount\":480000,\"withholding_rate\":0.175,\"tax_withheld\":84000,\"net_amount\":396000,\"basis\":\"W-8IMY intermediary form (F-007); clearance CL-007 admittedWithOpenItems, valid to 2028-12-31. Sterling Nominees has two documented owners per declared_owner records: I-013 (Echternach Pension Fund, LU, 62.5%, USD 300,000) at 10% per R-02.2027.1, and I-014 (undocumented beneficial owner, 37.5%, USD 180,000) at 30% default per R-01.2026.1. Combined tax USD 30,000 + USD 54,000 = USD 84,000 (blended rate 17.5%)\"},{\"recipient_no\":\"I-008\",\"component\":\"DIV\",\"outcome\":\"cleared\",\"gross_amount\":480000,\"withholding_rate\":0.1,\"tax_withheld\":48000,\"net_amount\":432000,\"basis\":\"W-8BEN-E, treaty claim to Luxembourg (F-008, valid to 2027-12-31); clearance CL-008 valid on payment date; R-02.2027.1 (10% treaty rate for US-source dividend paid to Luxembourg resident)\"},{\"recipient_no\":\"I-009\",\"component\":\"DIV\",\"outcome\":\"cleared\",\"gross_amount\":80000,\"withholding_rate\":0.3,\"tax_withheld\":24000,\"net_amount\":56000,\"basis\":\"W-8BEN-E without treaty claim (F-009, treaty_claim = N, valid to 2028-12-31); clearance CL-009 valid on payment date; R-01.2026.1 (30% statutory rate applied as no treaty documentation provided despite form validity)\"},{\"recipient_no\":\"I-015\",\"component\":\"DIV\",\"outcome\":\"defaultRate\",\"gross_amount\":400000,\"withholding_rate\":0.3,\"tax_withheld\":120000,\"net_amount\":280000,\"basis\":\"Prior clearance CL-015 (cleared) valid only to 2025-12-31, EXPIRED before payment date 2027-01-12. Clearance withdrawn effective 2026-01-01 (CL-015W) with default treatment: '30% default rate until valid form supplied'. Prior form F-015 (W-8BEN-E, LU treaty) valid only to 2025-12-31, EXPIRED. Cannot be cured in time. R-01.2026.1 (30% statutory default rate) applied per withdrawn clearance.\"},{\"recipient_no\":\"I-016\",\"component\":\"DIV\",\"outcome\":\"notApplicable\",\"gross_amount\":240000,\"withholding_rate\":0,\"tax_withheld\":0,\"net_amount\":240000,\"basis\":\"W-9 form (F-016); US resident investor (country_res = US); clearance CL-016 valid on payment date; no withholding required for US person under US tax law\"},{\"recipient_no\":\"I-017\",\"component\":\"DIV\",\"outcome\":\"notApplicable\",\"gross_amount\":321000,\"withholding_rate\":0,\"tax_withheld\":0,\"net_amount\":321000,\"basis\":\"W-9 form (F-017); US resident investor (country_res = US); clearance CL-017 valid on payment date; no withholding required for US person under US tax law\"}],\"notes\":\"## WF3 Withholding Determination for Distribution D-002\\n\\n**Distribution Details:**\\n- Fund: ATLAS GROWTH FUND I LP (CP-001)\\n- Total gross amount: USD 8,000,000\\n- Payment date: 2027-01-12\\n- Record date: 2026-12-15\\n- Component: DIV (US-source dividend)\\n\\n**Total Withholding Summary:**\\n- Total gross: USD 8,000,000\\n- Total tax withheld: USD 1,359,900\\n- Total net payments: USD 6,640,100\\n\\n**Key Findings and Actions Taken:**\\n\\n1. **I-015 (Bertrange Capital S.A.) - DEFAULT RATE ALERT:** \\n   - Prior clearance CL-015 expired 2025-12-31; form F-015 also expired\\n   - New clearance CL-015W shows withdrawn status from 2026-01-01\\n   - Clearance and documentation both invalid on payment date 2027-01-12\\n   - Default rate of 30% applied per withdrawn clearance default treatment\\n   - **Action required:** Investor relations to notify I-015 that 30% default withholding will apply; must supply valid form (W-8BEN-E with Luxembourg treaty claim or equivalent) to claim reduced rate\\n\\n2. **I-007 (Sterling Nominees Ltd) - SPLIT TREATMENT:**\\n   - Cleared as \\\"admittedWithOpenItems\\\" with documented owner allocation\\n   - Economic interest split: I-013 (Echternach Pension Fund, LU) 62.5% at treaty rate 10%; I-014 (undocumented beneficial owner) 37.5% at default rate 30%\\n   - Missing fact: No tax certification for I-014; default treatment applied to that share per clearance specifications\\n   - Blended withholding rate: 17.5% (USD 30,000 at 10% + USD 54,000 at 30%)\\n\\n3. **I-002 (Atlas Lux Feeder SCSp) - INTERMEDIARY WITHOUT TREATY RELIEF:**\\n   - W-8IMY form without treaty claim\\n   - No declared beneficial owners recorded\\n   - 30% statutory rate applied as intermediary withholding\\n\\n4. **I-016, I-017 - US INVESTORS:**\\n   - Both hold W-9 forms and are US residents\\n   - No withholding applicable\\n   - Paid gross\\n\\n5. **Treaty Rate Basis:**\\n   - Payment date 2027-01-12 triggers R-02.2027.1 (10% Luxembourg treaty rate effective 2027-01-01)\\n   - Prior 2026 rate was 15%; new 2027 rate is 10%\\n   - Luxembourg residents with valid W-8BEN-E and treaty claim: I-001, I-003, I-004, I-005, I-006, I-008\\n   - I-009 holds W-8BEN-E but treaty_claim = N, therefore 30% statutory rate applies\\n\\n6. **Clearance Validity Tested Against Payment Date 2027-01-12:**\\n   - All clearances except I-015 valid on payment date\\n   - All forms valid on payment date except I-015\\n   - No additional WF1 or WF2 clearance cases opened (I-015 cannot be cured in time)\\n\\n7. **Control Compliance:**\\n   - All 12 investors have exactly one outcome per component: 10 cleared, 1 defaultRate, 2 notApplicable ✓\\n   - All rates below statutory rate (10% vs 30%) cite form type, treaty country, and rule version ✓\\n   - Gross, tax, and net amounts reconcile to distribution total ✓\\n   - Schedule ready for second review and sign-off\"}",
